{"id":"a7e727ae818103d5ff33e7b991e4e6c5fe3dd238","axis":"silent","repo":"strapi/strapi","sha":"a7e727ae818103d5ff33e7b991e4e6c5fe3dd238","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/docs/docs/01-core/authentication/00-sessions-and-jwt.md","lines":["@@ -82,8 +82,8 @@ Configuration:"," - `admin.auth.options.*` — Use `admin.auth.sessions.options.*` instead"," - Cookie options:","   - `admin.auth.cookie.name` (default `jwtToken`) — name of the non-httpOnly access-token cookie used for session logins (when `rememberMe` is false) and EE SSO handoff. Rename to avoid collisions with another app on a shared parent domain that sets a `jwtToken` cookie. Requires an admin rebuild after change (value is inlined into the admin bundle at build time).","-  - `admin.auth.cookie.domain` (or `admin.auth.domain`) — applied to `strapi_admin_refresh`","-  - `admin.auth.cookie.path` (default `/admin`) — applied to `strapi_admin_refresh`","+  - `admin.auth.cookie.domain` (or `admin.auth.domain`) — applied to `strapi_admin_refresh` and to the non-httpOnly access-token cookie written by the admin client (and EE SSO). Defaults to a host-only cookie when unset. Requires an admin rebuild after change (value is inlined into the admin bundle at build time). Set a parent domain to share the admin session across subdomains; leave unset to keep each host isolated.","+  - `admin.auth.cookie.path` (default `/admin`) — applied to `strapi_admin_refresh` and to the non-httpOnly access-token cookie written by the admin client (and EE SSO). Requires an admin rebuild after change (value is inlined into the admin bundle at build time). Use a distinct path per instance when hosting multiple Strapis under the same parent domain.","   - `admin.auth.cookie.sameSite` (default `lax`) — applied to `strapi_admin_refresh`"," "," Key files:"],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/core/admin/admin/src/utils/cookies.ts","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@","+import { resolveAuthCookieDomain } from '../../../shared/